cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MyoSim in academic work, cite this software release and the declared task, replay, and provenance bundle."
title: "MyoSim: Reproducible Motor-Intent to Simulated-Action Research Demonstrator"
abstract: >-
  A local-first, software-only, non-clinical research platform for deterministic
  replay of motor-intent records through confidence-aware decision logic,
  bounded control, virtual prosthetic simulation, task metrics, and provenance
  reporting. This release does not establish clinical validation, hardware
  safety, decoder efficacy, or biomechanical equivalence.
type: software
